<title>JAPAN: JGBs end down, extend losses toward close.</title>
<headline>JGBs end down, extend losses toward close.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Key June 10-year JGB futures ended down after extending losses toward the close on position adjustment sales and as Tokyo share prices came off lows, traders said. *Recent rush of corporate bond launches also making JGBs heavy on the upperside, they said.</p>
</text>
